{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04FY", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{proposition-closed-immersion-pushforward}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:98a8a932dae0f6812d82c720aa6911680505cab7e8bde6769f80e6728ae69f70", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere is the general version of\nProposition <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3bc9e09f308a8ed0f5ce46fa657cb0d25ad6afa74340094fa27de4583fe8f53a", "unit_id": "tag:04FY:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proposition", "parent_tag": "04FY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$$\nf_{small, *} :\n\\Sh(X_\\etale)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Sh(Y_\\etale)\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$Y_\\etale$", "MATH_0005": "$Y \\setminus f(X)$", "MATH_0006": "$*$", "MATH_0007": "$$\nf_{small, *} :\n\\textit{Ab}(X_\\etale)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\textit{Ab}(Y_\\etale)\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$Y_\\etale$", "MATH_0009": "$f(X)$", "MATH_0010": "$f_{small}^{-1}$", "MATH_0011": "$f_{small, *}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proposition}\n\\label{proposition-integral-universally-injective-pushforward}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proposition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8e578f189683ab6490cb3aba9a3fd683d88710fa440bcc61d74d066c76870f3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bace8c97dcc6cc7876607f2c686c819cf13ff3d61af188bc03a55813f412f748", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes which is integral\nand universally injective.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The functor\n<MATH_0002>\nis fully faithful and its essential image is those sheaves of sets\n<MATH_0003> on <MATH_0004> whose restriction to <MATH_0005> is\nisomorphic to <MATH_0006>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> the functor\n<MATH_0007>\nis fully faithful and its essential image is those abelian sheaves on\n<MATH_0008> whose support is contained in <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nIn both cases <MATH_0010> is a left inverse to the functor\n<MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:64c96d615e7892fb0a4a2dcdb85527603cba215ee7bbcce9bc200b883d2b4e5e", "unit_id": "tag:04FZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04FY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX \\ar[r]^h & Z \\ar[r]^i & Y\n}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$h$", "MATH_0004": "$i : Z \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$i$", "MATH_0006": "$h$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{proposition-closed-immersion-pushforward}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{theorem-topological-invariance}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:94da6e179d507d2f8bbe3a482942a891d98102c416abd100b1c52517bfe50eba", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1a34030339bb310364277e286a2a36e38c424ea47bf2f9e3dda79413b79356dd", "source_text": "We may factor <MATH_0001> as\n<MATH_0002>\nwhere <MATH_0003> is integral, universally injective and surjective\nand <MATH_0004> is a closed immersion.\nApply\nProposition <REF_0001>\nto <MATH_0005> and apply\nTheorem <REF_0002>\nto <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9d3538645bcf3e10db03b8755835d32776fd541877256f3dc3f803a410425643", "unit_id": "tag:04FZ:proof"}
